Reset your password

Hello <%= @resource.email %>,

Someone requested a link to change the password on your Makerstorage
account. Open the link below to choose a new one:

<%= edit_user_password_url(reset_password_token: @token) %>

This link expires in <%= (Devise.reset_password_within / 3600).to_i %> hours.

If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email — your
password won't change until you open the link above and set a new one.
